  <sect1 id="unsupported-features-sql99">
   <title>不支持的特性</title>

   <para>
    下面这些 <acronym>SQL99</acronym> 中定义的特性在当前版本的
    <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 中尚未实现。在少数情况下，有等价的功能可用。

    <informaltable>
     <tgroup cols="4">
      <thead>
       <row>
        <entry>标识符</entry>
        <entry>包</entry>
        <entry>描述</entry>
        <entry>注释</entry>
       </row>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
       <row>
        <entry>B011</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>嵌入式 Ada</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B013</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>嵌入式 COBOL</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B014</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>嵌入式 Fortran</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B015</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>嵌入式 MUMPS</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B016</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>嵌入式 Pascal</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B017</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>嵌入式 PL/I</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B031</entry>
        <entry></entry>
        <entry>基本动态 SQL</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B032</entry>
        <entry></entry>
        <entry>扩展动态 SQL</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B032-1</entry>
        <entry></entry>
        <entry>&lt;describe input&gt; 语句</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B041</entry>
        <entry></entry>
        <entry>嵌入式 SQL 异常声明的扩展</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>B051</entry>
        <entry></entry>
        <entry>增强的执行权限</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E081</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>基本权限</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E081-05</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>列级 UPDATE 权限</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E081-07</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>列级 REFERENCES 权限</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E081-08</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>WITH GRANT OPTION</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E121</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>基本游标支持</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E121-04</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>OPEN 语句</entry>
        <entry>（游标）</entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E121-06</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>定位式 UPDATE 语句</entry>
        <entry>（游标）</entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E121-07</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>定位式 DELETE 语句</entry>
        <entry>（游标）</entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E121-17</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>WITH HOLD 游标</entry>
        <entry>游标在事务之间保持打开</entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E152</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>基本 SET TRANSACTION 语句</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E152-02</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>SET TRANSACTION 语句：READ ONLY 和 READ WRITE 子句</entry>
        <entry>语法被接受；不支持 READ ONLY</entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E153</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
        <entry>带子查询的可更新查询</entry>
        <entry></entry>
       </row>
       <row>
        <entry>E171</entry>
        <entry>核心</entry>
